I have used svn to search where the bug was added. It was in the commit wit=
h=20
BKrev 40d318ecmZTh_TlJh147qeftto1qZw and it was done in 2004-06-18 13:31:40=
=2E=20
Investigating further showed that the addition of the line=20

acpi_ut_evaluate_object(link->handle, "_DIS", 0, NULL);

causes the problem (see the attached patch). The comment

 /* disable all links -- to be activated on use */=20

suggests that maybe the some driver is not re-activating it.

I have attached the output of dmesg, dmidecode, acpidmp, lspci=20
and /proc/interrupts

Rafael =C1vila de Esp=EDndola

